# Etherium Abomination's unearth {1}{U}{B} (CR 702.84a): discarded to Faithless Looting (paid with a Mox Ruby) on turn 1, it
# can't be unearthed with Blasted Landscape's {C}, Mox Pearl's {W} and Mox Jet's {B} (as much mana as the cost, no blue), nor
# - Mox Jet tapped in the first main phase, its mana gone with the phase - with the {C}, {W} and Mox Sapphire's {U} (no
# black): both colored pips are pinned. On turn 3 it is unearthed, paid exactly with Blasted Landscape's {C} for the generic
# and the Jet's {B} and the Sapphire's {U}, leaving the pool empty (colorless mana for the generic leaves no room for another
# colored pip). It has haste and attacks for 4, and is exiled at the beginning of the next end step.

